# Keep secrets out of Cursor's Agent, Tab and @-mentions.
# Cursor already ignores .env* and everything in .gitignore by default; these add keys and credential files.
# .cursorignore does not stop terminal commands. The hooks in .cursor/hooks.json cover those.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa
**/id_ed25519
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/service-account*.json
**/.aws/credentials
